    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n115813" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψοφ-ητικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>able to make a noise,</i> of animals, opp. both to
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ἄφωνα</span> and to <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ φωνήεντα,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>HA</u>
				488a31
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ψ.</span>
			<i>a thing capable of producing sound,</i> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ὁρατόν,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>de An.</u>
				423b5
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				420a3
			</span></i>.</div>
